;; Wrong: correct translation, but bound to the wrong name. The puzzle
;; requires the name `answer`. Must FAIL: tests.scm asks the sandbox
;; for `answer` and gets an undefined-variable error, which crashes
;; the check process with a nonzero exit code (see harness.scm's note
;; on chibi -q having no working exception handling to catch this
;; more gracefully).
(stake translation (seal (signal star dust drift home)))
